> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash
Saved the query to `/app/solution.sparql`.

It:
- Matches full professors via `role` starting with `"Professor"` (thereby excluding Assistant/Associate Professors).
- Joins each professor’s departments to their universities and countries.
- Uses the 2025-08-16 reference date to count only students whose enrollment has started and who have not yet graduated.
- Requires at least one department in an EU member state (the 27 official 2025 EU ISO codes) and at least one department with more than 10 currently enrolled students.
- Groups by professor and concatenates all countries where they work.

Expected results from the provided data:

| professorName | countries |
|---|---|
| Orfeas Menis | GR, US |
| Pepe Attanasio | GR, PT |
| Aristotle Tympas | GR |
